{
  "id": "E010",
  "title": "Buying a Cellphone",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-04-02",
  "synopsis": "Buying a cellphone in China? See an example of how the conversation might go in this dialogue between a man buying a cellphone and the female store clerk.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/99/0914a73a154b9d96e47beefacd713d5580e06bef.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "买手机\n \nA：你想买什么牌子的手机？\nB：不知道，你们卖哪些牌子的手机？\nA：我们有苹果、三星、小米。\nB：它们有什么区别？\nA：其实没有区别，都差不多。\nB：质量呢？哪一个最好？\nA：质量也都一样。\nB：我不知道买哪一个好。它们是什么国家的？\nA：苹果是美国的牌子，三星来自韩国，小米是国内的牌子。\nB：我买一个小米。买国内的好，这样对中国的经济有帮助。\nA：但是这三个牌子的手机都是在中国生产的。如果你想支持中国的经济，买哪一个牌子的手机都一样。\nB：算了，这个事情太复杂了。",
    "traditional": "買手機\n \nA：你想買什麼牌子的手機？\nB：不知道，你們賣哪些牌子的手機？\nA：我們有蘋果、三星、小米。\nB：它們有什麼區別？\nA：其實沒有區別，都差不多。\nB：質量呢？哪一個最好？\nA：質量也都一樣。\nB：我不知道買哪一個好。它們是什麼國家的？\nA：蘋果是美國的牌子，三星來自韓國，小米是國內的牌子。\nB：我買一個小米。買國內的好，這樣對中國的經濟有幫助。\nA：但是這三個牌子的手機都是在中國生產的。如果你想支持中國的經濟，買哪一個牌子的手機都一樣。\nB：算了，這個事情太複雜了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n \n",
      "traditional": "\n \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Buying a Cellphone"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "A：你想买什么牌子的手机？",
      "traditional": "A：你想買什麼牌子的手機？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me pái zi de shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: What brand of cellphone would you like to buy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "B：不知道，你们卖哪些牌子的手机？",
      "traditional": "B：不知道，你們賣哪些牌子的手機？",
      "pinyin": "bù zhī dào nǐ men mài nǎ xiē pái zi de shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: I don't know. Which brands of cellphones do you sell?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "A：我们有苹果、三星、小米。",
      "traditional": "A：我們有蘋果、三星、小米。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men yǒu píng guǒ sān xīng xiǎo mǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: We have Apple, Samsung, and Xiaomi."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "B：它们有什么区别？",
      "traditional": "B：它們有什麼區別？",
      "pinyin": "tā men yǒu shén me qū bié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: What differences do those three brands have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "A：其实没有区别，都差不多。",
      "traditional": "A：其實沒有區別，都差不多。",
      "pinyin": "qí shí méi yǒu qū bié dōu chà bu duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: Actually there are no differences, they're all similar."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "B：质量呢？哪一个最好？",
      "traditional": "B：質量呢？哪一個最好？",
      "pinyin": "zhì liàng ne nǎ yí ge zuì hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: What about the quality? Which one is the best?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "A：质量也都一样。",
      "traditional": "A：質量也都一樣。",
      "pinyin": "zhì liàng yě dōu yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: The quality is also similar."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "B：我不知道买哪一个好。它们是什么国家的？",
      "traditional": "B：我不知道買哪一個好。它們是什麼國家的？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bù zhī dào mǎi nǎ yí ge hǎo tā men shì shén me guó jiā de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: I don't know which one is the best to buy. Which countries do those brands come from?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "A：苹果是美国的牌子，三星来自韩国，小米是国内的牌子。",
      "traditional": "A：蘋果是美國的牌子，三星來自韓國，小米是國內的牌子。",
      "pinyin": "píng guǒ shì měi guó de pái zi sān xīng lái zì hán guó xiǎo mǐ shì guó nèi de pái zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: Apple is an American brand, Samsung is from South Korea, Xiaomi is a domestic brand."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "B：我买一个小米。买国内的好，这样对中国的经济有帮助。",
      "traditional": "B：我買一個小米。買國內的好，這樣對中國的經濟有幫助。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi yí ge xiǎo mǐ mǎi guó nèi de hǎo zhè yàng duì zhōng guó de jīng jì yǒu bāng zhù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: I'll buy a Xiaomi. It's good to buy domestic brands, that way it helps the Chinese economy."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "A：但是这三个牌子的手机都是在中国生产的。",
      "traditional": "A：但是這三個牌子的手機都是在中國生產的。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì zhè sān ge pái zi de shǒu jī dōu shì zài zhōng guó shēng chǎn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "如果你想支持中国的经济，买哪一个牌子的手机都一样。",
      "traditional": "如果你想支持中國的經濟，買哪一個牌子的手機都一樣。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ xiǎng zhī chí zhōng guó de jīng jì mǎi nǎ yí ge pái zi de shǒu jī dōu yí yàng",
      "english": "A: But the cellphones of these three brands are all made in China."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you want to support the Chinese economy, it's all the same whichever brand of cellphone you buy."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "B：算了，这个事情太复杂了。",
      "traditional": "B：算了，這個事情太複雜了。",
      "pinyin": "suàn le zhè ge shì qing tài fù zá le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
