    "sentence_translations": [
      "Buying a Cellphone",
      "",
      "A: What brand of cellphone would you like to buy?",
      "",
      "B: I don't know. Which brands of cellphones do you sell?",
      "",
      "A: We have Apple, Samsung, and Xiaomi.",
      "",
      "B: What differences do those three brands have?",
      "",
      "A: Actually there are no differences, they're all similar.",
      "",
      "B: What about the quality? Which one is the best?",
      "",
      "A: The quality is also similar.",
      "",
      "B: I don't know which one is the best to buy. Which countries do those brands come from?",
      "",
      "A: Apple is an American brand, Samsung is from South Korea, Xiaomi is a domestic brand.",
      "",
      "B: I'll buy a Xiaomi. It's good to buy domestic brands, that way it helps the Chinese economy.",
      "",
      "A: But the cellphones of these three brands are all made in China.",
      "If you want to support the Chinese economy, it's all the same whichever brand of cellphone you buy.",
      "",
      "B: Forget it, this matter is too complicated."
    ]
